Trauma Surgery, Neurosurgery, Thoracic Surgery,

483
26:03.790 --> 26:05.310
Urology, and all related departments,

484
26:05.310 --> 26:07.750
activate the Level III emergency response protocol immediately!

485
26:07.750 --> 26:09.640
Multiple severely injured patients

486
26:09.640 --> 26:10.840
are inbound to the ER.

487
26:10.920 --> 26:13.160
Trauma Surgery, Neurosurgery, Thoracic Surgery,

488
26:13.160 --> 26:14.680
Urology, and all related departments,

489
26:14.680 --> 26:17.270
activate the Level III emergency response protocol immediately!

490
26:17.270 --> 26:18.830
Multiple severely injured patients

491
26:18.830 --> 26:19.880
-Gauze, bandages, -are inbound to the ER.

492
26:19.880 --> 26:20.550
-normal saline, -Trauma Surgery,

493
26:20.550 --> 26:22.200
-and disinfectant. Prepare plenty of them. -Neurosurgery, Thoracic Surgery...

494
26:22.200 --> 26:22.550
Okay.

495
26:22.590 --> 26:24.270
Urology, and all related departments,

496
26:24.270 --> 26:26.070
activate the Level III emergency response protocol immediately!

497
