Multiple severely injured patients

505
26:35.090 --> 26:37.900
[Hospital Admission Registration]

506
26:36.790 --> 26:38.030
are inbound to the ER.

507
26:38.110 --> 26:40.300
[Outpatient Prescription Pickup]

508
26:38.200 --> 26:40.240
Trauma Surgery, Neurosurgery, Thoracic Surgery,

509
26:40.240 --> 26:42.030
Urology, and all related departments,

510
26:42.030 --> 26:43.990
activate the Level III emergency response protocol immediately!

511
26:43.990 --> 26:49.520
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

512
26:49.580 --> 26:51.480
[10:50]

513
26:51.540 --> 26:54.730
[Stroke Center; Chest Pain Center]

514
26:53.590 --> 26:54.450
Stop chatting.

515
26:55.720 --> 26:56.400
It's freezing out here.

516
26:56.400 --> 26:57.640
Are we just going to wait outside?

517
26:57.640 --> 26:58.920
Then go wait inside.

518
27:00.480 --> 27:01.500
It's been over 20 minutes.

519
27:01.500 --> 27:03.110
Why haven't they come back yet?

520
27:03.110 --> 27:03.920
Maybe...

521
27:03.320 --> 27:06.900
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

522
27:05.880 --> 27:06.640
Maybe something

523
27:06.640 --> 27:07.640
happened on the way.

524
27:07.640 --> 27:09.700
What could've happened? A car crash?

525
27:10.830 --> 27:13.830
"The good speak little; the impatient speak much."

526
27:15.440 --> 27:16.570
What does that mean?

527
27:17.400 --> 27:18.660
It means stop yapping.

528
27:22.050 --> 27:26.120
[Emergency]

529
27:26.140 --> 27:29.760
[Emergency Access Route; No Parking]

530
27:29.160 --> 27:29.880
It's done.

531
27:29.760 --> 27:33.960
[Emergency Resuscitation]

532
27:30.000 --> 27:30.930
Liu Zhengliang?

533
27:31.510 --> 27:32.240
Zhengliang!

534
27:32.240 --> 27:32.720
Yu.

535
27:33.400 --> 27:34.460
Isn't that Dr. Liu?

536
27:43.900 --> 27:48.730
[Emergency Access Route; No Parking]

537
27:44.310 --> 27:45.510
What's going on here?

538
27:46.790 --> 27:48.120
Lining up to welcome me?

539
27:48.550 --> 27:49.240
How did you know

540
27:49.240 --> 27:50.570
I was coming back today?

541
27:51.440 --> 27:52.550
Latest news:

542
27:52.960 --> 27:54.590
the people injured in the car accident

543
27:54.590 --> 27:56.310
were all sent to the Second Hospital.

544
27:56.310 --> 27:58.880
That was a collective decision by the injured.

545
27:58.880 --> 27:59.980
What does that have to do with

546
27:59.980 --> 28:00.640
what we're talking about?

547
28:00.640 --> 28:01.640
Of course it does.

548
28:03.110 --> 28:04.640
The Second Hospital is 7 minutes farther

549
28:04.640 --> 28:05.510
from the accident scene

550
28:05.510 --> 28:06.880
than yours is.

551
28:06.960 --> 28:08.400
The injured would rather

552
28:08.510 --> 28:10.350
risk an extra 7 minutes

553
28:10.350 --> 28:11.880
than come to your hospital.

554
28:12.270 --> 28:13.590
Doesn't that tell you something?

555
28:13.590 --> 28:14.480
It shows that some people

556
28:14.480 --> 28:16.410
are biased against this hospital.

557
28:16.880 --> 28:18.210
We need to correct that.

558
28:18.350 --> 28:21.070
Your last financial audit showed that your hospital was suffering serious losses.

559
28:21.070 --> 28:21.830
Xiaoximen Hospital

560
28:21.830 --> 28:23.590
has no reason to exist anymore.

561
28:23.590 --> 28:24.590
That's not

562
28:24.590 --> 28:25.640
for you to decide.

563
28:26.000 --> 28:27.510
The people of Xiaoximen will decide.

564
28:27.510 --> 28:28.110
You...

565
28:30.750 --> 28:33.640
This is necessary to integrate primary healthcare resources.

566
28:33.640 --> 28:35.030
I'm here to inform you.

567
28:35.270 --> 28:36.640
We've already decided:

568
28:36.640 --> 28:38.640
Xiaoximen Hospital must be closed.

569
28:39.790 --> 28:40.920
If you're willing,

570
28:41.110 --> 28:43.640
you can go to the Second Hospital as a vice president

571
28:43.640 --> 28:45.030
and coast until retirement.

572
28:45.030 --> 28:46.160
If not,

573
28:46.750 --> 28:47.550
you can retire right here and now.

574
28:47.550 --> 28:48.640
Suit yourself.

575
28:55.030 --> 28:56.350
You can't just close the hospital like that!

576
28:56.350 --> 28:59.070
How am I supposed to explain this to everyone here?

577
28:59.070 --> 29:00.790
There's no room for negotiation!

578
29:00.790 --> 29:02.240
Stop fighting it, Long!

579
29:05.050 --> 29:09.480
[Decision-Making Procedure for "Three Major and One Important" Matters]

580
29:18.000 --> 29:20.320
[Decision-Making Procedure for "Three Major and One Important" Matters]

581
29:26.480 --> 29:27.680
No one can come in now.

582
29:28.680 --> 29:29.310
President...

583
29:29.310 --> 29:30.270
Don't speak yet.

584
29:39.070 --> 29:40.160
What the heck?

585
29:40.200 --> 29:40.960
The hospital's about to be closed,

586
29:40.960 --> 29:42.290
and you can still laugh?

587
29:43.000 --> 29:44.800
Those are two different things.

588
29:54.240 --> 29:55.350
About...

589
29:56.590 --> 29:59.000
A-About what happened in Fuzhou,

590
29:59.510 --> 30:01.240
I really didn't know anything.

591
30:01.270 --> 30:03.200
I called to ask about it afterward.

592
30:03.790 --> 30:05.110
You were just unlucky.

593
30:05.550 --> 30:07.830
If you'd arrived 2 days earlier and joined,

594
30:07.830 --> 30:08.620
Hong Bin's trouble

595
30:08.620 --> 30:10.220
wouldn't have affected you.

596
30:14.160 --> 30:15.360
You don't believe me?

597
30:16.230 --> 30:18.400
I do. How could I not?

598
30:21.590 --> 30:22.400
Thank you.

599
30:23.350 --> 30:25.810
Thank you for everything you've done for me.

600
30:25.920 --> 30:26.830
You being so polite all of a sudden

601
30:26.830 --> 30:28.490
makes me very uncomfortable.

602
30:28.720 --> 30:30.400
I went away for a while.

603
30:30.480 --> 30:32.610
Thought I'd come back with a new style.

604
30:32.720 --> 30:33.880
What? You got into trouble?

605
30:33.880 --> 30:34.590
Nothing.

606
30:34.640 --> 30:36.240
What trouble could there be?

607
30:38.310 --> 30:41.110
Didn't you say you'd rather starve than come back?

608
30:41.270 --> 30:43.350
It's not that I couldn't find a good job elsewhere!

609
30:43.350 --> 30:44.480
I just feel this lousy place

610
30:44.480 --> 30:45.440
needs me more.

611
30:56.160 --> 30:58.560
Xiaoximen Hospital is on its last legs too.

612
31:09.510 --> 31:10.110
Doctor,

613
31:10.350 --> 31:12.110
I was working at a construction site

614
31:12.110 --> 31:13.510
and fell, hurting my leg.

615
31:13.510 --> 31:14.970
Come on, let me take a look.

616
31:20.700 --> 31:22.320
[Nurses' Station]

617
31:21.240 --> 31:22.240
Come on, sit here.

618
31:22.680 --> 31:27.630
[Yellow Zone]

619
31:25.510 --> 31:26.310
Be careful.

620
31:27.720 --> 31:30.540
[Nurses' Station]

621
31:34.160 --> 31:34.830
You have...

622
31:35.030 --> 31:36.240
a laceration on your right calf,

623
31:36.240 --> 31:37.640
and it's still bleeding.

624
31:38.310 --> 31:39.960
I thought I'd treat it myself,

625
31:39.460 --> 31:47.660
[Yellow Zone]

626
31:40.000 --> 31:41.800
but it just won't stop bleeding.

627
31:41.830 --> 31:42.550
Come on.

628
31:42.550 --> 31:43.240
With a gash this big,

629
31:43.240 --> 31:44.790
how can you treat it yourself?

630
31:44.790 --> 31:45.790
You need stitches.

631
31:45.790 --> 31:46.640
Go register.

632
31:47.590 --> 31:49.350
Well, I don't have my ID card with me.

633
31:47.660 --> 31:51.160
[Nurses' Station]

634
31:49.590 --> 31:51.250
My family is bringing it over.

635
31:51.400 --> 31:53.790
Can the doctor stitch me up first?

636
31:54.070 --> 31:55.330
You don't have your ID?

637
31:56.680 --> 31:57.480
Then do this.

638
31:57.480 --> 31:58.030
Get a blank registration form

639
31:58.030 --> 31:59.590
from the registration window.

640
31:59.590 --> 32:00.440
Pay the fee,

641
32:00.440 --> 32:01.680
and I'll have the doctor treat you first.

642
32:01.680 --> 32:02.830
Come find me after you've been treated.

643
32:02.830 --> 32:03.480
Okay.

644
32:03.680 --> 32:04.480
Be careful.

645
32:04.510 --> 32:05.310
I'll go find you a doctor.

646
32:05.310 --> 32:05.960
Okay.

647
32:07.720 --> 32:08.510
You really didn't know Zhengliang

648
32:08.510 --> 32:09.440
was coming back?

649
32:09.440 --> 32:10.160
I swear, I was just as surprised

650
32:10.160 --> 32:11.000
as you guys.

651
32:11.000 --> 32:12.070
I only found out

652
32:12.070 --> 32:13.160
when I saw him.

653
32:13.160 --> 32:14.960
Who? Talking about Zhengliang?

654
32:15.240 --> 32:16.230
I saw it coming!

655
32:16.750 --> 32:17.720
Oh, come on.

656
32:17.720 --> 32:18.830
Who was it that so firmly said

657
32:18.830 --> 32:19.640
he'd never come back,

658
32:19.640 --> 32:22.030
and even that he was completely heartbroken?

659
32:22.030 --> 32:23.270
I-I just forgot

660
32:23.270 --> 32:25.240
that Zhengliang is different from others.

661
32:25.240 --> 32:26.070
Some people just

662
32:26.070 --> 32:27.510
run away when their hearts are broken.

663
32:27.510 --> 32:28.550
But Zhengliang?

664
32:28.550 --> 32:30.440
He can come back and sew his heart up.

665
32:30.440 --> 32:31.440
How does he sew it?

666
32:33.310 --> 32:34.920
There's a patient outside with a laceration on his leg.

667
32:34.920 --> 32:36.240
Then he needs stitches.

668
32:36.240 --> 32:37.110
The bleeding is under control.

669
32:37.110 --> 32:38.710
Who's going to stitch him up?

670
32:40.510 --> 32:41.310
I'll do it.

671
32:42.310 --> 32:43.000
Let me do this. Let me.

672
32:43.000 --> 32:43.640
This way.

673
32:44.400 --> 32:45.200
Hurry, hurry.

674
32:47.000 --> 32:48.240
The good old days are back.

675
32:48.240 --> 32:50.310
Um, these photos are from security.

676
32:50.640 --> 32:51.480
Every doctor is required

677
32:51.480 --> 32:52.880
to take a look at the man in them.

678
32:52.880 --> 32:53.480
Here.

679
32:53.880 --> 32:54.350
Here you go.

680
32:54.350 --> 32:56.830
Okay, okay, okay.

681
32:57.490 --> 33:02.540
[Du Fang]

682
32:58.960 --> 33:00.240
He looks quite sharp.

683
33:00.400 --> 33:02.260
I can tell at a glance he's no good.

684
33:06.590 --> 33:07.920
What are you staring at?

685
33:09.920 --> 33:12.070
I'm waiting for my family to bring my ID card over.

686
33:12.070 --> 33:13.440
Don't worry.

687
33:13.480 --> 33:15.070
I'll stitch you up first.

688
33:15.640 --> 33:18.270
Then I'll give you a tetanus shot.

689
33:18.960 --> 33:19.830
Just to be safe.

690
33:20.750 --> 33:21.950
Stitches are enough.

691
33:21.960 --> 33:23.420
No need for a tetanus shot.

692
33:24.550 --> 33:25.270
This is a hospital.

693
33:25.270 --> 33:27.070
Who's the doctor here, you or me?

694
33:30.640 --> 33:35.720
[Employment Contract]

695
33:45.630 --> 33:49.360
[Party B (Signature): Liu Zhengliang]

696
34:05.400 --> 34:07.460
Welcome back to Xiaoximen Hospital.

697
34:07.790 --> 34:08.719
President Long,

698
34:08.920 --> 34:10.230
when can I start work?

699
34:12.000 --> 34:12.880
Dr. Liu,

700
34:13.230 --> 34:14.630
whenever you're ready.

701
34:14.670 --> 34:15.360
Okay.

702
34:15.480 --> 34:17.210
Then I'll go let everyone know.

703
34:20.840 --> 34:21.639
Wait a minute.

704
34:21.960 --> 34:24.290
There's something I need to return to you.

705
34:32.920 --> 34:39.130
[Miracle Worker; Zhang Dexu & Dou Liping]

706
34:43.590 --> 34:45.650
Zhang Jiao was discharged last week.

707
34:48.400 --> 34:49.530
She can speak again?

708
34:52.030 --> 34:52.840
The thank-you banner wasn't

709
34:52.840 --> 34:54.639
delivered until after you left.

710
34:56.150 --> 34:58.150
Now it's back to its rightful owner.

711
35:02.190 --> 35:03.990
This is the best news I've gotten

712
35:04.710 --> 35:05.840
since coming back.

713
35:08.190 --> 35:09.720
Take a look at this, Junnan.

714
35:10.280 --> 35:11.360
There was, um,

715
35:11.400 --> 35:12.400
a car accident

716
35:12.400 --> 35:13.260
on the highway—

717
35:13.360 --> 35:14.110
a pile-up.

718
35:14.110 --> 35:15.400
And one of the vehicles was a police van

719
35:15.400 --> 35:16.710
transporting prisoners.

720
35:16.710 --> 35:17.920
T-Two police officers

721
35:17.920 --> 35:19.670
and three prisoners were all injured.

722
35:19.670 --> 35:21.030
And the prisoners escaped right afterward.

723
35:21.030 --> 35:21.840
Security has circulated pictures

724
35:21.840 --> 35:23.110
for everyone to see.

725
35:23.400 --> 35:24.480
They probably took a detour and ran away.

726
35:24.480 --> 35:25.960
They wouldn't come to Xiaoximen.

727
35:25.960 --> 35:27.110
The police already have.

728
35:27.110 --> 35:28.710
They're at our entrance.

729
35:29.030 --> 35:30.110
There are police stationed at

730
35:30.110 --> 35:31.240
every hospital now.

731
35:31.320 --> 35:32.190
Someone said...

732
35:32.190 --> 35:33.400
said that whoever spots the fugitives

733
35:33.400 --> 35:34.960
will get a 5,000 yuan reward.

734
35:34.960 --> 35:36.190
Who'd want t-that money?

735
35:36.190 --> 35:37.030
A 5,000 yuan reward?

736
35:37.030 --> 35:38.150
Then I'd better take a good look.

737
35:38.150 --> 35:38.800
No way.

738
35:38.800 --> 35:40.280
T-They'd better not come to our hospital.

739
35:40.280 --> 35:42.070
It'd be a mess if they did.

740
35:54.840 --> 35:55.760
No, no, no!

741
35:55.920 --> 35:56.510
Don't yell.

742
35:56.510 --> 35:57.000
Bro!

743
35:57.000 --> 35:57.550
You hear me?

744
35:57.550 --> 35:58.280
W-We won't yell!

745
35:58.280 --> 35:59.400
Make one more noise, and I'll stab you both!

746
35:59.400 --> 35:59.840
Do you hear me?

747
35:59.840 --> 36:00.480
No, no, no.

748
36:00.390 --> 36:03.330
[Supply Room]

749
36:01.110 --> 36:01.760
Um...

750
36:02.760 --> 36:03.400
Bro.

751
36:03.400 --> 36:04.030
Don't say a word.

752
36:04.030 --> 36:05.230
Okay, okay, we won't.

753
36:05.760 --> 36:06.360
Bro.

754
36:09.590 --> 36:10.480
A fugitive has come to our hospital.

755
36:10.480 --> 36:11.760
-Call security! Call security! -He's come to our hospital!

756
36:11.760 --> 36:13.620
Call the police! Call the police!

757
36:13.760 --> 36:15.190
Stay clear of him! Stay clear of him!

758
36:14.530 --> 36:14.820
[Quiet]

759
36:15.000 --> 36:16.570
[Quiet]

760
36:15.400 --> 36:16.600
He's in our hospital!

761
36:16.630 --> 36:17.760
Get out of the way!

762
36:18.880 --> 36:19.840
Stay clear of him! Out of his way!

763
36:19.840 --> 36:20.770
He's got a knife!

764
36:21.150 --> 36:22.550
Quick, hide! Hide!

765
36:22.800 --> 36:23.800
Hide! Quick, hide!

766
36:22.910 --> 36:24.940
[Stroke Center; Green Channel]

767
36:25.630 --> 36:26.690
What are you doing?

768
36:28.280 --> 36:28.760
Quick!

769
36:30.230 --> 36:31.030
Police!

770
36:31.110 --> 36:32.000
He's got a knife!

771
36:32.000 --> 36:32.920
Get the...

772
36:32.470 --> 36:34.090
[Police]

773
36:35.030 --> 36:35.960
Police! Freeze!

774
36:36.440 --> 36:38.030
Get all the patients and medical staff out of the way!

775
36:37.270 --> 36:40.430
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

776
36:38.110 --> 36:39.040
He's got a knife!

777
36:39.710 --> 36:41.670
He's got a knife! He's got a knife!

778
36:41.670 --> 36:42.280
Du Fang!

779
36:42.280 --> 36:42.800
Freeze!

780
36:43.590 --> 36:44.550
He's got a knife!

781
36:47.880 --> 36:49.400
Du Fang! Freeze!

782
36:58.400 --> 36:59.480
Du Fang, stop right there!

783
36:59.480 --> 37:00.150
Freeze!

784
37:02.360 --> 37:03.020
Don't move!

785
37:03.230 --> 37:04.110
Nobody move!

786
37:04.480 --> 37:05.110
Calm down!

787
37:05.590 --> 37:06.630
Put the knife down!

788
37:06.630 --> 37:07.550
Sir! Sir!

789
37:07.800 --> 37:08.800
Violence against healthcare workers is illegal!

790
37:08.800 --> 37:09.800
Take it up with whoever wronged you.

791
37:09.800 --> 37:10.670
I-I'm a good doctor.

792
37:10.670 --> 37:12.270
Look, me, "Miracle Worker."

793
37:12.280 --> 37:13.710
Say another word, and I'll kill you!

794
37:13.710 --> 37:14.760
Put the knife down.

795
37:14.760 --> 37:16.070
-Put it down. -Put it down!

796
37:16.070 --> 37:17.280
You can't escape now!

797
37:17.230 --> 37:18.320
[Riot Control]

798
37:17.360 --> 37:18.420
Put the knife down!

799
37:18.420 --> 37:21.450
[Surgical Inpatient Department]

800
37:18.550 --> 37:19.320
Everyone else, stay back!

801
37:19.320 --> 37:20.150
Don't come closer!

802
37:20.150 --> 37:21.350
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

803
37:22.960 --> 37:24.670
Du Fang, you can't escape!

804
37:24.520 --> 37:26.980
[Inpatient Unit] [Nurses' Station]

805
37:24.800 --> 37:25.860
Put the knife down!

806
37:26.280 --> 37:27.610
I'm not going to prison!

807
37:27.840 --> 37:29.110
I didn't do anything!

808
37:29.280 --> 37:30.590
I'm innocent!

809
37:31.750 --> 37:32.550
Step back!

810
37:33.000 --> 37:33.920
All of you, step back!

811
37:33.920 --> 37:34.670
Step back!

812
37:34.000 --> 37:36.470
[Riot Control]

813
37:34.670 --> 37:36.000
Bystanders, stay back!

814
37:36.440 --> 37:37.840
Think about your family!

815
37:38.280 --> 37:39.630
I have no family left!

816
37:40.190 --> 37:41.710
Come any closer, and I'll kill him!

817
37:41.710 --> 37:42.230
Put it down! Put it down!

818
37:42.230 --> 37:43.030
Don't, don't, don't!

819
37:43.030 --> 37:44.000
All of you, back off!

820
37:44.000 --> 37:45.030
Du Fang, calm down!

821
37:45.030 --> 37:45.840
Calm down!

822
37:45.840 --> 37:46.760
We can talk this out!

823
37:46.760 --> 37:47.280
Step back!

824
37:47.280 --> 37:47.750
[Police]

825
37:47.780 --> 37:48.160
[Police]

826
37:48.220 --> 37:48.380
[Police]

827
37:48.450 --> 37:48.760
[Police]

828
37:48.820 --> 37:49.120
[Police]

829
37:49.160 --> 37:50.050
[West Gate]

830
37:50.050 --> 37:52.050
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

831
37:51.510 --> 37:53.070
Du Fang, put the knife down!

832
37:58.230 --> 37:59.030
Freeze!

833
38:00.150 --> 38:00.960
Du Fang.

834
38:01.760 --> 38:02.960
You can't escape now!

835
38:03.920 --> 38:05.150
You've only been sentenced to 2 years.

836
38:04.200 --> 38:07.050
[Riot Control]

837
38:05.550 --> 38:06.400
Why take things

838
38:06.400 --> 38:07.150
to this extreme?

839
38:07.150 --> 38:09.410
I don't want to spend a single day in jail!

840
38:10.400 --> 38:12.030
I'm really innocent!

841
38:12.280 --> 38:14.280
You assaulted your boss and caused minor injuries.

842
38:14.280 --> 38:15.230
The facts are clear!

843
38:15.230 --> 38:16.000
Nonsense!

844
38:17.920 --> 38:19.550
Growing up, whenever I saw people fighting,

845
38:19.550 --> 38:20.950
I always stayed far away.

846
38:21.190 --> 38:23.250
How could I possibly have hit anyone?

847
38:24.110 --> 38:25.710
The law is all about evidence.

848
38:25.710 --> 38:27.400
It's not about what you say.

849
38:29.150 --> 38:30.710
What freaking evidence?

850
38:31.550 --> 38:32.840
It's all fake!

851
38:33.110 --> 38:33.920
Calm down.

852
38:34.150 --> 38:35.510
-Calm down. -Put your gun down!

853
38:35.510 --> 38:37.110
You put the knife down first...

854
38:35.590 --> 38:40.440
[Riot Control]

855
38:37.110 --> 38:38.400
Well, bro!

856
38:38.400 --> 38:39.320
Bro, calm down.

857
38:39.320 --> 38:40.360
C-Can I say something?

858
38:40.360 --> 38:41.150
L-Look, you see,

859
38:41.150 --> 38:42.000
you came to our hospital,

860
38:42.000 --> 38:43.510
and we stitched up your wounds

861
38:43.510 --> 38:44.360
and bandaged you.

862
38:44.360 --> 38:45.510
Nobody here has tried to hurt you.

863
38:45.510 --> 38:46.230
You know?

864
38:46.230 --> 38:48.440
He didn't do anything to you.

865
38:48.440 --> 38:49.550
And you're treating him like this...

866
38:49.550 --> 38:51.000
Y-You are both young.

867
38:51.000 --> 38:52.930
It's not easy for anyone, you know?

868
38:53.070 --> 38:54.400
I-I am the president.

869
38:55.320 --> 38:56.510
H-How about I take his place?

870
38:56.510 --> 38:57.550
Huang! Huang!

871
38:58.190 --> 38:58.840
Huang!

872
38:59.000 --> 38:59.960
There are police! The police are here!

873
38:59.960 --> 39:00.960
The police are here.

874
39:00.340 --> 39:03.860
[Riot Control]

875
39:01.880 --> 39:02.670
Du Fang.

876
39:03.030 --> 39:03.960
Trust me.

877
39:04.510 --> 39:05.280
We'll definitely ask the judge

878
39:05.280 --> 39:06.550
to be lenient with you.

879
39:07.670 --> 39:09.320
You're all lying to me.

880
39:10.400 --> 39:11.800
Not one of you is sincere!

881
39:11.800 --> 39:13.030
You're all liars!

882
39:35.510 --> 39:36.550
What's going on? What happened?

883
39:36.270 --> 39:40.620
[Neurosurgery Inpatient Unit]

884
39:36.550 --> 39:37.880
W-What's going on?

885
39:44.880 --> 39:46.140
Let us check your neck.

886
40:01.840 --> 40:02.800
We can still save him.

887
40:02.800 --> 40:03.630
Get him to the ER!

888
40:03.630 --> 40:03.920
Quick, quick!

889
40:03.920 --> 40:04.550
Crash cart!

890
40:04.550 --> 40:05.320
Crash cart!

891
40:05.480 --> 40:06.030
Hurry!

892
40:13.110 --> 40:14.190
Imaging shows

893
40:14.190 --> 40:16.110
the bullet passed through the right side of the skull,

894
40:16.110 --> 40:18.030
involving the temporal and occipital bones.

895
40:18.030 --> 40:19.920
About... a dozen bone fragments.

896
40:20.150 --> 40:20.920
Cerebral contusion and laceration

897
40:20.920 --> 40:22.780
with an intracerebral hematoma.

898
40:22.840 --> 40:23.800
The midline structures are significantly compressed

899
40:23.800 --> 40:25.110
and shifted to the left.

900
40:25.110 --> 40:28.170
Fortunately, there is no damage to the deep brainstem.

901
40:30.070 --> 40:31.280
We'll perform a craniotomy immediately

902
40:31.280 --> 40:32.150
to evacuate the hematoma

903
40:32.150 --> 40:35.150
and remove any foreign bodies remaining in the skull.

904
40:35.320 --> 40:36.070
Zhengliang,

905
40:36.480 --> 40:38.280
look at his right temporal area.

906
40:39.280 --> 40:40.030
The density there

907
40:40.030 --> 40:41.230
really isn't right.

908
40:41.550 --> 40:44.010
There seems to be a space-occupying lesion.

909
40:46.150 --> 40:47.610
Let's save his life first.

910
40:47.760 --> 40:49.630
We can confirm it while evacuating the hematoma.

911
40:49.630 --> 40:49.880
Okay.

912
40:49.880 --> 40:53.280
Alright. Let's start debriding and disinfecting the wound.

913
40:59.190 --> 41:00.190
Bipolar forceps.

914
41:19.840 --> 41:20.480
Here.

915
41:22.630 --> 41:23.960
Evacuate the hematoma.

916
41:25.440 --> 41:26.070
Scalpel.

917
41:26.480 --> 41:27.030
Scalpel.

918
41:30.800 --> 41:31.930
Forceps, scissors.

919
41:34.000 --> 41:36.260
Give me the bipolar forceps and suction.

920
41:37.230 --> 41:37.880
Mingming,

921
41:37.880 --> 41:38.960
get the microsurgical scissors ready.

922
41:38.960 --> 41:41.000
Be prepared to cut any blood vessels I cauterize.

923
41:41.000 --> 41:41.480
Okay.

924
41:41.550 --> 41:42.070
Junnan.

925
41:42.230 --> 41:44.760
Irrigate the surgical field intermittently

926
41:45.030 --> 41:47.030
and keep the cerebral cortex moist.

927
41:47.150 --> 41:47.840
Got it.

928
41:47.920 --> 41:48.920
Alright, cut.

929
41:50.320 --> 41:51.380
Hemostatic gauze.

930
41:51.480 --> 41:52.610
And gelatin sponge.

931
42:01.460 --> 42:02.090
Why didn't you tell me in advance

932
42:02.090 --> 42:03.680
that you were coming back?

933
42:04.840 --> 42:07.030
It all happened so suddenly. There was no time to tell you.

934
42:07.030 --> 42:09.090
Didn't you say you'd never come back?

935
42:09.320 --> 42:10.710
Are you trying to ease your nerves

936
42:10.710 --> 42:11.910
by making small talk?

937
42:15.030 --> 42:16.150
I'm not nervous.

938
42:16.960 --> 42:17.800
What makes me nervous is

939
42:17.800 --> 42:19.590
that he almost killed you.

940
42:19.920 --> 42:20.710
Look at your wound.

941
42:20.710 --> 42:22.240
Another half a centimeter,

942
42:22.440 --> 42:24.110
and the consequences would have been unthinkable.

943
42:24.110 --> 42:25.960
So you think he's a bad guy,

944
42:26.920 --> 42:29.520
and it doesn't matter whether he lives or dies?

945
42:34.190 --> 42:35.850
I feel much less stressed now.

946
42:36.360 --> 42:37.490
What about you guys?

947
42:50.760 --> 42:52.670
Okay, I get it.

948
42:52.880 --> 42:54.140
In the operating room,

949
42:54.510 --> 42:56.240
there are no good or bad people,

950
42:56.400 --> 42:57.510
only patients.

951
43:00.400 --> 43:01.400
Be professional.

952
43:03.710 --> 43:05.070
The hematoma is almost cleared.

953
43:05.070 --> 43:06.710
That space-occupying lesion we saw

954
43:06.710 --> 43:07.920
on the scan earlier—

955
43:08.070 --> 43:08.760
is it here?

956
43:09.590 --> 43:10.450
Yes, it's here.

957
43:11.230 --> 43:13.000
Take a tissue sample for pathology.
